    "title": "Learn how to save lives - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n8 hours ago PLANTATION KEY — National Alliance on Mental Illness (NAMI) Miami-Dade is providing a free evidenced-based suicide prevention training at 10 a.m. Saturday, Sept. 13 at Coral Isles Church, mile marker 90, oceanside.\nThis session will teach the attendees how to identify warning signs that someone may be considering suicide, how to intervene and persuade them to get help, and refer them to appropriate resources.\nCall the church office at 305-852-5813 with questions. All are welcome.",
